        },
        {
          "text": " Aga nigo maziina g'amamanzi agu Daudi yaabaire aine; Yehoshebashebesi owa Takimooni niwe yaabaire ari mukuru omuri abo abashatu; akakwata eicumu rye, yaariitsa abantu magana munaana omurundi gumwe.",
          "type": "text",
